{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19218","headline":"马大夫见示浙西王侍御赠答诗因命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"马大夫见示浙西王侍御赠答诗因命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆逐羊车凡几时，今来旧府统戎师。\n象筵照室会词客，铜鼓临轩舞海夷。\n百越酋豪称故吏，十洲风景助新诗。\n秣陵从事何年别，一见琼章如素期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}